// BlackShield's libyara module list. It replaces libyara/modules/module_list (modules.c includes
// <modules/module_list>, and this directory comes first on the include path).
//
// Only what Android malware rules use is built: `dex` (classes, methods, strings of DEX files) and
// `math` (entropy, to spot packed or encrypted payloads). Everything else (pe, elf, macho, dotnet,
// hash, magic, cuckoo, console, time, string, tests) is left out to keep the library small; rules
// that import them fail to compile with "unknown module", and are rejected.
MODULE(dex)
MODULE(math)
